<section id="A1.SS5.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.5.1 </span>Setups for EgoNight-VQA Experiments.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we describe the model setup, how GPT is used as the judge, the prompting strategy, the GPU resources, and the approximate runtime for each dataset.
For the closed-source model, we directly use the API call. For open source models, we use LLama-Factory <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib70" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zheng et al. (2024)</a></cite> except VideoLLama3 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib66" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhang et al. (2023b)</a></cite> and EgoGPT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib61" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yang et al. (2025)</a></cite>. We use NVIDIA A6000 GPUs for all the model, except for Qwen2.5-VL-72B, we use 2 NVIDIA H200 GPUs for larger GPU memory. The inference speed for each model is shown in Tab. <a href="#A1.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ A.5 More Experiments Setups ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ EgoNight: Towards Egocentric Vision Understanding at Night with a Challenging Benchmark" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>. Video frames are sampled at 2 fps for EgoNight-Synthetic, and 1 fps for EgoNight-Sofia and EgoNight-Oxford, without imposing a maximum frame limit. To further ensure fairness and consistency, the exact prompts used for each task are provided below.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model Evaluation Prompt.</span> For evaluating the language model, we use the following prompt:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:397.5pt;">
<div id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p3.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F9F9F9;"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">Please</span><span id="lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">carefully</span><span id="lstnumberx1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">read</span><span id="lstnumberx1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">the</span><span id="lstnumberx1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">question</span><span id="lstnumberx1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">,</span><span id="lstnumberx1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">use</span><span id="lstnumberx1.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">the</span><span id="lstnumberx1.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">visual</span><span id="lstnumberx1.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">cues</span><span id="lstnumberx1.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">in</span><span id="lstnumberx1.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">the</span><span id="lstnumberx1.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.24" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">{</span><span id="lstnumberx1.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">video</span><span id="lstnumberx1.26" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">}</span><span id="lstnumberx1.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">to</span><span id="lstnumberx1.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx1.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">the</span><span id="lstnumberx1.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">question</span><span id="lstnumberx1.35" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">:</span><span id="lstnumberx1.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.37" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">{</span><span id="lstnumberx1.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">question</span><span id="lstnumberx1.39" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">}.</span>
