<div id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Evaluation Protocol.</span> Since the questions and answers are open-ended, we utilize GPT-4.1 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">Achiam et al. (2023)</a></cite> as a judge. Here is the prompt for evaluating the score given the model prediction, the ground truth answer, and the corresponding question:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:397.5pt;">
<div id="A1.SS5.SSS1.p5.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx7" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">role</span><span id="lstnumberx7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">:</span><span id="lstnumberx7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">system</span><span id="lstnumberx7.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">,</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx8" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">content</span><span id="lstnumberx8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">:</span><span id="lstnumberx8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">You</span><span id="lstnumberx8.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">are</span><span id="lstnumberx8.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">an</span><span id="lstnumberx8.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">intelligent</span><span id="lstnumberx8.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">chatbot</span><span id="lstnumberx8.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">designed</span><span id="lstnumberx8.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">for</span><span id="lstnumberx8.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">evaluating</span><span id="lstnumberx8.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">the</span><span id="lstnumberx8.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">correctness</span><span id="lstnumberx8.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">of</span><span id="lstnumberx8.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">AI</span><span id="lstnumberx8.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">assistant</span><span id="lstnumberx8.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">predictions</span><span id="lstnumberx8.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">for</span><span id="lstnumberx8.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">question</span><span id="lstnumberx8.35" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">-</span><span id="lstnumberx8.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx8.37" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_italic"> </span><span id="lstnumberx8.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_italic">pairs</span><span id="lstnumberx8.39" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span>
