<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 14: </span>Qualitative Result on one meta sample of spatial retrieval. The query video clip and the database video clips are visualized in the image. The table below the figure shows the similarity score between the query and the database clips calculated with different methods. The most similar one is in <span id="A1.F14.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>, and correct retrieval is in <span id="A1.F14.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#00FF00;">green</span>, and the incorrect one is in <span id="A1.F14.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">red</span>.</figcaption>
